{"unit_id":"kenryu42__cc-safety-net#card-zh","repo":"kenryu42/cc-safety-net","commit":"6f34af1f777ba28d331b7809a2bb087a001d353d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**CC Safety Net**（DeepSeek Harness 工具插件）：在 DSH 的工具调用前检查命令和路径。它通过 `tools.guard` 接入，将 `bash`、`pwsh` 调用交给共享策略管线，按策略检查命令和敏感路径，并在阻止时返回说明；对已执行但未声明的自定义命令工具，它会补充一次提示。适合希望在 DSH 会话里统一应用命令规则的开发者。安装器支持 web 与 Desktop profile；需要 Node.js 22 或更高版本，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/entries/deepseek-harness/index.ts:3-7","src/hosts/deepseek-harness/guard.ts:44-67","src/gate/pipeline.ts:248-300","src/hosts/deepseek-harness/install.ts:101-132"]}
{"unit_id":"kenryu42__cc-safety-net#card-en","repo":"kenryu42/cc-safety-net","commit":"6f34af1f777ba28d331b7809a2bb087a001d353d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**CC Safety Net** (DeepSeek Harness tool plugin) checks `bash` and `pwsh` calls before execution, returning a reason when policy blocks them. It also flags undeclared custom command tools after execution. Supports web and Desktop profiles; requires Node.js 22+, no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/entries/deepseek-harness/index.ts:3-7","src/hosts/deepseek-harness/guard.ts:44-67","src/gate/pipeline.ts:248-300","src/hosts/deepseek-harness/install.ts:101-132"]}
